SELECT * FROM pg_aggregate where aggfnoid in (
        'avg(bigint)'::regprocedure::regproc,
        'my_average1'::regproc,
        'my_average2'::regproc,
        'my_average3'::regproc,
        'my_average4'::regproc
  );
  aggfnoid      |   aggtransfn   | agginvtransfn  |  aggprelimfn   | agginvprelimfn  | aggfinalfn | aggsortop | aggtranstype | agginitval | aggordered 
----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+-----------------+------------+-----------+--------------+------------+------------
